    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I have a distant, almost nostalgic relationship with mathematics. It was once a language of logic that fascinated me, but over time, my engagement waned, especially as formal education progressed. I still appreciate its elegance, particularly in physics and philosophy, but I rarely engage with it actively now, especially given my current unemployment and focus on other interests like classical music and hiking.",
